            "use_secondary_background": false,
            "heading": "Description",
            "tab_content": "<p>Encourage a lifelong love of reading with the MORENDA Kids Bookshelf. Inspired by Montessori principles, its front-facing design allows children to easily see, choose and return their favourite books independently, helping build confidence while making reading a natural part of everyday life.</p><p>The double-sided design provides generous storage without taking up unnecessary floor space, keeping books beautifully organised and always within easy reach. Crafted from premium solid wood with smooth rounded edges, it is designed to be both durable and safe for growing families.</p><p>Whether placed in a nursery, bedroom or playroom, the MORENDA Kids Bookshelf blends seamlessly into modern interiors while creating a calm, inviting reading corner. More than just a storage solution, it is a thoughtfully designed piece that encourages curiosity, independence and a lasting love of books.</p>"
